#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup.md:247
msgid ""
"A notable setting to be aware of is `ice_host_override` under the `[rtc]`"
" section. You may need to configure this setting explicitly, particularly"
" when RTCD is deployed behind NAT, in complex network topologies, or when"
" automatic address discovery via STUN is unreliable. Setting "
"`ice_host_override` directly to your server's public IP address or "
"hostname is the preferred approach."
