#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup.md:364
msgid ""
"When a call starts, the Mattermost server examines the available RTCD "
"servers (via the configured DNS record) and starts the call on the RTCD "
"server with the lowest CPU usage. All participants in the call will "
"connect to that RTCD server; a single call cannot be shared across "
"multiple servers."
